      "note": "Nothing here is AI-attributed. The measured gain -- VerilogEval-v2 official PASS 130 -> 132 over 156 problems, zero regressions -- comes from four DETERMINISTIC emitters that already existed on disk and that nothing imported; no model runs on that path and the two recovered problems are named (Prob031_dff, Prob136_m2014_q6). Not more trials either: one emit per problem, single-shot, scored by each problem's own official _ref.sv + _test.sv under iverilog, controlled against the same harness with EMITTERS truncated to the shipped two. The one change that could be mistaken for an accuracy gain is stated as buying nothing: the conformance gate refuses 0 of 262 live emits. The third test is that gate's negative control -- it proves the measurement can still go red."
